$items=@(
 @{title='Living Ornament: reusable organic pattern visual';kind='epic';body='Create a separate animated visual inspired by the second reference painting. Preserve the existing Living Painting. Deliver five batches: remove the arbitrary graph node ceiling; complex shapes and first visual; pattern vocabulary; artistic orchestration and continuous motion; controlled structural transformations. User approved implementation, parallel independent lanes, and one integrated review/publication cycle per batch. Evaluate actual Lux images and animation for varied silhouettes, localized complexity, nested forms, bold boundaries, coherent motif families, density/rest, warm/cool anchors and stable temporal identity. Iterate material artistic defects before publication. Each child includes review, validation, Library publication and merge; no separate stage tickets.'},
